              <div style="background: #f8fafc; border-radius: 12px; padding: 24px; margin-bottom: 24px;">
                <h3 style="margin: 0 0 16px 0; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; color: #0f172a;">
                  Here's what you can do:
